      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having a shader tag would be useful if we need to pass in some parameter, but I think a more elegant solution (which many others have brought up) for simply enabling it would be tying the depth buffer to a component you can attach to your avatar. This allows existing effects to continue working without editing the shader code directly, which is an intimidating task for most beginner creators.",
