      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{643edcaa488fde18e402d5c4|full_name} as much as it'd be nice to do that, one could argue that adding a tag makes sense as in the modern SRPs you have to declare a depth only shader tag to access the depth buffer for custom effects relating to the depth. While this might not be ideal for some, this is a more futureproofed option.",
